If you have by mistake commited secrets in your previuos commits and now you are faciong problems in pushing your code even when you have removed the secrets, then

Follow these steps ->

1) use git reset--soft 'commit hash' here you wiull move to previos commit until when everything was correct and no secret were commited

2) use git status and check if everything you are gong to commit is correct or not

3) now commit and push, your changes will be pushed

